YOUR BENEFITS AT A GLANCE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

INPATIENT HOSPITALIZATION
Your plan covers medically necessary inpatient admissions at in-network EPO
facilities. After your $2,000 deductible is satisfied, you pay 30% of
covered charges (coinsurance) until you reach the $8,150 out-of-pocket
maximum. Prior authorization is required for all non-emergency admissions.
ICU, surgical services, and anesthesia are included.

OUTPATIENT SERVICES
Office visits, lab work, and diagnostic imaging are covered after your
deductible. Primary care visits: $35 copay. Specialist visits: $70 copay.
Outpatient surgery and procedures are subject to your deductible and 30%
coinsurance. Preventive care visits are covered at 100% — no cost to you —
when using an in-network provider, regardless of deductible status.

PRESCRIPTION DRUGS
Prescriptions are covered through the MeridianPathway 2025 Formulary:

  Tier 1 — Generics              : $12 per 30-day supply
  Tier 2 — Preferred Brand       : $50 per 30-day supply
  Tier 3 — Non-Preferred Brand   : $100 per 30-day supply
  Tier 4 — Specialty Drugs       : 35% coinsurance (max $350 per fill)

90-day mail-order fills are available for maintenance medications at 2.5x
the applicable 30-day copay. Specialty drugs require prior authorization.
Use only MeridianPathway participating pharmacies for covered benefits.

MATERNITY AND NEWBORN CARE
Prenatal visits are covered at 100% (no deductible, no copay) with an
in-network OB/GYN or certified nurse-midwife. Inpatient labor and delivery
is covered after deductible + 30% coinsurance. Postpartum care includes
two follow-up visits at the standard PCP copay. Your newborn is covered from
birth; you must add the newborn to your policy within 30 days of delivery.
Breast pump equipment is covered at no cost under federal preventive
care guidelines.

MENTAL HEALTH AND SUBSTANCE USE DISORDER
Consistent with the Mental Health Parity and Addiction Equity Act, mental
health and substance use disorder benefits are provided at parity with
medical benefits. Covered services include:

  - Outpatient therapy (individual or group)  : $40 copay per session
  - Psychiatrist visits                        : $70 copay
  - Inpatient psychiatric care                 : Deductible + 30% coinsurance
  - Intensive Outpatient Programs (IOP)        : $40 copay per session
  - Telehealth behavioral health sessions      : $40 copay per session
  - Substance use disorder residential treatment: Prior auth required;
                                                  deductible + 30% coinsurance

No PCP referral is required to access outpatient behavioral health services.

