WHAT IS NOT COVERED
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The following services are excluded from your plan:

  * Cosmetic Surgery: Procedures performed solely to alter appearance,
    including rhinoplasty, facelifts, liposuction, breast augmentation,
    and blepharoplasty. Reconstructive surgery following a covered illness
    or accidental injury is covered.

  * Experimental and Investigational Treatments: Services, drugs, or
    devices not approved by the FDA for the applicable indication, or
    classified as investigational by MeridianPathway's Medical Policy
    Board based on available clinical evidence.

  * Out-of-Network Services: As an EPO plan, non-emergency care received
    outside the MeridianPathway Western EPO Network is not covered and
    will be billed entirely to you.

  * Routine Dental and Vision: Not included under this policy.

  * Long-Term Custodial Care: Personal care and daily living assistance
    not requiring skilled medical supervision.

A complete exclusion schedule is available in your Policy Certificate,
accessible at meridianpathwayhealth.com/member-portal.

