PRIOR AUTHORIZATION: The following require prior authorization before
services are rendered — elective inpatient admissions, MRI/CT/PET imaging,
outpatient surgery, specialty drug dispensing, home health care, and durable
medical equipment exceeding $500. Unauthorized services may be denied.
To request prior authorization, call 1-877-MERIDIAN or submit via the
member portal.

MEMBER PORTAL: Manage your policy at meridianpathwayhealth.com/member-portal.
You can view your claims, find in-network providers, request ID cards,
check deductible and out-of-pocket balances, and submit appeals online.

MEMBER ID CARD: Your physical ID card will arrive within 7-10 business days.
A digital ID card is available immediately through the member portal or the
MeridianPathway mobile app (iOS and Android).

